Conclusion: the narrowed scan is not a rubber stamp. It fails loudly, on its
own, the moment the ghost it exists to check for is actually gone -- which
is exactly the property the pre-016 whole-grid scan lost once every field's
help line started rendering `dimmed` too (see
original-assertion-red.log in this same directory).
